      "width": 400,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Heartbeat design library: definitions only, documentation — design/system/design-system.pen.\nVariables mirror design-system/tokens (source of truth: Kotlin); icons — HbIcons.kt, illustrations — IllustrationArtwork.kt.\nImport: \"imports\": {\"hb\": \"<path>/heartbeat.lib.pen\"}; ref \"hb:<id>\", \"$hb:<variable>\", theme {\"hb:mode\": \"dark\"}."
